{"step_index":440,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T00:12:53Z","thinking":"**Classifying KSIC industrial codes**\n\nAnalyzing the provided 25 items requires KSIC (Korean Standard Industrial Classification) codes from the 10th/11th revisions. The first item, `구조용 금속제품 제조업`, falls under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing; Except Machinery and Furniture\" (25), and \"Structural Metal Product, Tank and Steam Generator Manufacturing\" (251). The second item, `그 외 기타 금속가공제품 제조업`, is also categorized under \"Manufacturing\" (C) at the top level. The goal is to accurately classify all 25 items using the KSIC system.\n\n\n**Classifying remaining industrial items**\n\nThe third item, `금속 열처리업`, belongs to \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing; Except Machinery and Furniture\" (25), and \"Metal Heat Treatment, Plating and Other Surface Treatment\" (2592). The fourth item, `금속파스너, 스프링 및 금속선 가공제품 제조업`, is also categorized under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing; Except Machinery and Furniture\" (25), and \"Other Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing\" (2594). Next, `기타 기계·장비 조립용 플라스틱 제품 제조업` is classified under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Rubber and Plastic Product Manufacturing\" (22), and \"Plastic Product Manufacturing\" (222).\n\n\n**Continuing KSIC code classification**\n\n`내연기관 제조업` is categorized as \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Other Machinery and Equipment Manufacturing\" (29), and \"General Purpose Machinery Manufacturing\" (291). Following this, `농업 및 임업용 기계 제조업` falls under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Other Machinery and Equipment Manufacturing\" (29), and \"Special Purpose Machinery Manufacturing\" (292). The next item, `목재 포장용 상자, 드럼 및 유사용기 제조업`, is classified under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Wood and Wood Product Manufacturing; Except Furniture\" (16), and \"Other Wood Product Manufacturing\" (162).\n\nThe classification of `반도체 제조업` is \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Electronic Components, Computer, Audio, Video and Communication Equipment Manufacturing\" (26), and \"Semiconductor Manufacturing\" (261). `분말 야금제품 제조업` is under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing; Except Machinery and Furniture\" (25), and \"Other Fabricated Metal Product Manufacturing\" (259). Finally, `운송장비 조립용 플라스틱제품 제조업` is categorized as \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Rubber and Plastic Product Manufacturing\" (22), and \"Plastic Product Manufacturing\" (222).\n`일반 목적용 기계 제조업` is also classified under \"Manufacturing\" (C), \"Other Machinery and Equipment Manufacturing\" (29), and \"General Purpose Machinery Manufacturing\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst content = fs.readFileSync('merged_500_perfect.tsv', 'utf-8');\nconst lines = content.split('\\n');\nconst dSet = new Set();\nconst jSet = new Set();\nconst sSet = new Set();\nlines.forEach(l => {\n  const p = l.split('\\t');\n  if (p[15]) dSet.add(p[15]);\n  if (p[16]) jSet.add(p[16]);\n  if (p[17]) sSet.add(p[17].trim());\n});\nconsole.log('Dae:', Array.from(dSet));\nconsole.log('Jung (sample):', Array.from(jSet).slice(0, 15));\nconsole.log('So (sample):', Array.from(sSet).slice(0, 15));\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\import_company_database_list","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking existing taxonomy in merged_500_perfect.tsv","toolSummary":"Check taxonomy"}}]}
